Package: taco
Type: Package
Title: Read TACO Datasets
Version: 0.8.1
Authors@R: person("Cesar", "Aybar", email = "cesar@asterisk.coop",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read TACO v3 datasets through the native TACO core. The core
    resolves ZIP, FOLDER, and TACOCAT containers, local or remote, and the
    package reads their metadata with DuckDB through one API.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/asterisk-labs/taco
BugReports: https://github.com/asterisk-labs/taco/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
SystemRequirements: C++23, libcurl (>= 7.83.0), OpenSSL (>= 3.0)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    cli (>= 3.0.0),
    duckdb (>= 1.5.5),
    DBI,
    jsonlite,
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
